// trap: a `.lemma()` reads a run mark (#428), and the rule is proved. The model is
// z3_needs_run_mark.rdra: Open_1 sets a door ajar only while no light is off, Open_2 lights a
// sign with no guard, and TurnOff waits while a door is ajar or a sign is lit. The CTI there
// is a door between Open's two steps beside a light off, which differs from the reachable
// state Prop leaves (a door ajar, a light off) only in the door's run mark. The lemma states
// that no light is off while a door is in Open's run (`Door.in_run(Open)`); it holds at every
// bound and makes the rule inductive, so z3 proves both. A lemma z3 kept must not have a BFS
// counterexample either. `verify` runs no cone for the lemma, and the rule's cone does not
// hold it, so only `check` at one instance checks it.
// expect MultiForbidden_Light_0: native=ok tlc=ok z3=proved bfs=ok,ok,ok
// expect MultiForbidden_Light_1: native=none tlc=none z3=proved bfs=ok,none,none
// expect Deadlock_Light_state_on: native=counterexample tlc=counterexample
// expect Deadlock_Sign_state_dark: native=counterexample tlc=counterexample
entity Light "照明" { id: Int @pk  state: Enum(on, off) @default(on) }
entity Door "扉" { id: Int @pk  state: Enum(closed, ajar) @default(closed) }
entity Sign "標識" { id: Int @pk  state: Enum(dark, lit) @default(dark) }
usecase Install "照明設置"
usecase Fit "扉設置"
usecase Hang "標識設置"
usecase TurnOff "消灯"
usecase Prop "扉を押さえる"
usecase Open "開放"
api DoorApi "扉 API"
api SignApi "標識 API"
creates(Install, Light)
creates(Fit, Door)
creates(Hang, Sign)
transitions(TurnOff, Light.state, on -> off)
transitions(Prop, Door.state, closed -> ajar)
invokes(Open, DoorApi)
updates(DoorApi, Door)
transitions(Open, Door.state, closed -> ajar)
invokes(Open, SignApi)
updates(SignApi, Sign)
transitions(Open, Sign.state, dark -> lit)
condition LightsOn "消えた照明がない"
holds(LightsOn, Door.state == closed).none(Light.state == off)
applies_to(LightsOn, Open)
condition DoorsShut "押さえた扉がない"
holds(DoorsShut, Light.state == on).none(Door.state == ajar)
applies_to(DoorsShut, TurnOff)
condition SignsDark "点いた標識がない"
holds(SignsDark, Light.state == on).none(Sign.state == lit)
applies_to(SignsDark, TurnOff)
forbidden(Light, Sign, Light.state == off, Sign.state == lit).global()
forbidden(Light, Door, Light.state == off, Door.in_run(Open)).global().lemma()
